🏗 Modern Way (Class Syntax – Behind the Scene Prototype)
class Animal {
  speak() {
    console.log("Animal speaks");
  }
}

class Dog extends Animal {
  bark() {
    console.log("Dog barks");
  }
}

const myDog = new Dog();

myDog.speak(); // inherited
myDog.bark();


⚠️ Important:
Class syntax sirf sugar hai.
Andar se JavaScript prototype hi use karta hai.

