🎯 Short Me Definition (Interview Ready)

Prototypal inheritance is a mechanism in JavaScript where objects inherit properties and methods from other objects via the prototype chain.




🔥 __proto__ vs prototype — Clear Difference (Story + Diagram + Code)

Bahut important interview question hai 💯
Chalo simple language me samjhte hain.

🧠 Sabse Pehle Short Difference
prototype	                                  __proto__

Function ka property hota hai	              Har object ka hidden link hota hai
Future objects ko inherit karata hai	      Already created object ka parent link hota hai
Constructor functions ke saath use hota hai	  Object ka internal prototype reference hota hai

